Increase qrexec-agent env_buf to PATH_MAX so it holds Guix store paths
(e.g. /gnu/store/...-bash-minimal/bin/bash); the fixed 64-byte buffer
truncates them.  Harmless on all distributions.

Upstream: QubesOS/qubes-core-qrexec, agent/qrexec-agent.c.
Status: should-upstream (a generally-useful fix, harmless on all
distributions); intended for submission to the Qubes project.

diff --git a/agent/qrexec-agent.c b/agent/qrexec-agent.c
index 5fb4f6f..2a56f37 100644
--- a/agent/qrexec-agent.c
+++ b/agent/qrexec-agent.c
@@ -146,7 +146,7 @@ _Noreturn void do_exec(const char *prog, const char *cmd, const char *user)
     struct passwd pw_copy;
     pid_t child, pid;
     char **env;
-    char env_buf[64];
+    char env_buf[PATH_MAX];
     char *arg0;
     char *shell_basename;
 #endif
